      "body": "<!-- nemo-ci-review-impact:v1 ceiling=none -->\n\nLGTM. The [attribute addition](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/44bd22caec00342b73ba76a850db3fec4f2e1823/megatron/core/distributed/fsdp/src/megatron_fsdp/experimental/module_utils.py#L40-L60) preserves the marker through meta materialization and sharded-parameter creation, matching the existing delayed-wgrad hook selection. The [regression test](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/44bd22caec00342b73ba76a850db3fec4f2e1823/tests/unit_tests/distributed/mfsdp_v2/test_parameter.py#L216-L237) checks that it survives wrapping.\n\nNo qualifying findings. Static review only; tests weren't run.\n\n> **Note:** formal approval is not available for this request, so this review is posted as a comment only.\n\n*Review generated by codex. This was a full review. Request a full review with `/review reset=true`.*\n\n<!-- nemo-ci-review-rendering:inline-v1 -->\n<!-- nemo-ci-formal-review:5e695b83d81ac043d8dc249b45b93efe379468cd0e097f8ea82e735782e5e882:913e3b6e7d3ce0d7fb560895673fdc7dd95954397190cab3c383ecefe471c912 -->",
